# Agentic SDLC Framework

This project uses the Agentic SDLC Framework in `sdlc/`.

Before significant work:

- Read `sdlc_artifacts/STATE.md` when it exists.
- Read `sdlc_artifacts/context.md` when it exists.
- Use the relevant prompt in `sdlc/prompts/`.

The Implementation Gate is defined in `implementation-gate.mdc` and is mandatory. Do not edit product code without an approved change proposal — see that file for the exact procedure.

Do not edit `sdlc/` unless the task is to maintain the framework itself.
